2026-05-09 17:01:09,179 - INFO - - Personality traits do shift measurably over a lifetime, especially in young adulthood and in response to major life events
2026-05-09 17:01:09,179 - INFO - - Therapy and deliberate effort can produce genuine personality changes
2026-05-09 17:01:09,179 - INFO - - People consistently report being different than they were years ago, and longitudinal studies confirm this
