2026-05-09 17:02:54,229 - INFO - - Many situations people think require lying actually don't—honesty plus boundary-setting often works better
2026-05-09 17:02:54,229 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:02:54,229 - INFO - The serious philosophical position isn't "lying is fine whenever," but rather "absolute prohibitions on lying fail to account for genuine moral conflicts." When protecting innocent life requires deception, most defensible ethical systems allow it.
2026-05-09 17:02:54,230 - INFO - 
