2026-05-09 17:05:48,335 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:05:48,335 - INFO - **What science cannot do:**
2026-05-09 17:05:48,335 - INFO - - Answer *why* questions about purpose or meaning ("Why does suffering exist?" "What should I value?")
2026-05-09 17:05:48,335 - INFO - - Prove or disprove claims outside the physical world (God, souls, metaphysical claims)
2026-05-09 17:05:48,335 - INFO - - Determine what *ought* to be, only what *is* (values, ethics, goals)
2026-05-09 17:05:48,335 - INFO - - Explain itself—why the laws of nature exist rather than nothing, or why mathematics describes reality
2026-05-09 17:05:48,335 - INFO - 
