2026-05-09 17:05:48,336 - INFO - Science is the best tool we have for understanding the physical universe through observation and testing. But "explaining everything" requires answering questions science isn't designed to answer. That doesn't make science less valuable—it just means other frameworks (philosophy, ethics, personal reflection) also have a role.
2026-05-09 17:05:48,336 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:05:48,336 - INFO - Your friend might be confusing "science is very powerful" with "science is the only valid way of understanding reality," which is a philosophical claim that science itself can't prove.
