2026-05-09 17:06:07,895 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:06:07,895 - INFO - The reasonable stance is agnosticism: we don't know. Life on Earth emerged through chemistry and physics, both of which operate everywhere in the universe. But we also don't know how common the conditions for life actually are, or how often it arises when conditions are met.
2026-05-09 17:06:07,895 - INFO - 
