2026-05-09 17:19:46,663 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:19:46,663 - INFO - 1. **"Inevitably leads to"** is too strong. Unrestricted speech doesn't automatically produce these harms in all contexts—many democracies with strong free speech protections maintain civil discourse and resist dangerous ideologies effectively through counter-speech, education, and institutional resilience.
2026-05-09 17:19:46,664 - INFO - 
