2026-05-09 17:19:46,664 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:19:46,664 - INFO - 3. **"Reasonable limitations"** glosses over the hard part. Everyone agrees *some* limits make sense (direct incitement to violence, etc.), but you're arguing for something broader without specifying where the line goes or who decides.
