2026-05-09 17:19:46,664 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:19:46,665 - INFO - **The honest answer:** This is genuinely difficult. The empirical question—whether democracies with stronger vs. weaker speech protections end up better off—doesn't have a clean answer. The philosophical question is legitimately contested. Your statement treats one side of a real debate as obviously correct.
