2026-05-09 17:21:51,584 - INFO - **What's fair here:**
2026-05-09 17:21:51,584 - INFO - - Some environmental discourse does employ quasi-religious framing and moral absolutism
2026-05-09 17:21:51,585 - INFO - - Carbon offsets can function more as symbolic redemption than measurable mitigation
2026-05-09 17:21:51,585 - INFO - - Certain environmental advocates do resist empirical pushback
