2026-05-09 17:23:09,084 - INFO - - Longevity treatments will initially be expensive and accessible mainly to the wealthy—that's historically true for most medical advances. This *is* a legitimate concern worth discussing.
2026-05-09 17:23:09,085 - INFO - - Resource allocation questions around life extension are genuine ethical issues.
2026-05-09 17:23:09,085 - INFO - 
