2026-05-09 17:23:49,915 - INFO - - Credentialism has genuinely increased. Employers often require degrees for jobs that didn't previously need them, making education partly a signaling mechanism.
2026-05-09 17:23:49,916 - INFO - - Tuition costs have risen dramatically and disconnected from salary outcomes in many fields.
